    "title": "Off-roading for a cause, Thurston Co. Sheriff's Jeep Patrol looking for volunteers - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By AJ Janavel ,\n3 hours ago THURSTON COUNTY, Wash. - Thurston County Sheriff's Jeep Patrol is looking for volunteers who want to go off-roading for a good cause. The Thurston County Sheriff's Jeep Patrol started in the 1970s with more than 70 commissioned officers. Since the 1990s, the group has evolved into a citizen-led volunteer team. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
